  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ApexStudios-Dev/.github/refs/heads/master/assets/minecraft/fantasyfurniture_venthyr/banner.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"573\" height=\"149\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Venthyr</strong> 家具套装，适用于 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fantasys-furniture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Fantasy's Furniture</strong></a>，添加多种完全可交互的家具，包括但不限于：<strong>箱子</strong>、<strong>抽屉</strong>、<strong>床</strong>、<strong>座椅</strong>等！</p>\n<p>本家具套装的设计大量借鉴了 <strong>Venthyr</strong> 盟约的风格，该设计源自 <strong>《魔兽世界》</strong> 的 <strong>《暗影国度》资料片</strong>。</p>\n<h3>合成配方</h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>要合成 <strong>Venthyr 木板</strong>/<strong>Venthyr 羊毛</strong>，你需要放入 <strong>#minecraft:planks</strong>/<strong>#minecraft:wool</strong>。</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ApexStudios-Dev/.github/refs/heads/master/assets/minecraft/fantasyfurniture_venthyr/stonecutter_planks.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ApexStudios-Dev/.github/refs/heads/master/assets/minecraft/fantasyfurniture_venthyr/stonecutter_wool.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>要合成 <strong>Venthyr</strong> 家具方块，你需要将 <strong>#fantasyfurniture:binding_agent</strong>、<strong>Venthyr 木板</strong> 和 <strong>Venthyr 羊毛</strong> 放入 <strong>家具工作站</strong> 中进行合成。</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ApexStudios-Dev/.github/refs/heads/master/assets/minecraft/fantasyfurniture_venthyr/furniture_station.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.apexmodder.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">加入我们的 <strong>Discord</strong> 服务器</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.apexmodder.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ApexStudios-Dev/.github/refs/heads/master/assets/third_party/discord_banner.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"174\" height=\"59\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fapexstudios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/f4d8198a-6c2a-4d86-8d74-1977589e8ef7.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
